OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo: Hundreds of homes
OL,4,Astill without power
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of properties across
OL,7,FLancashire are still without power
OL,8,Fafter Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FSP Electricity North West said it hoped
OL,11,Fto restore power to around 600 homes
OL,12,Fand businesses by Tuesday night at the
OL,13,Flatest.
OL,15,FThe areas affected include Morecambe,
OL,16,FBurnley and Preston, as well as 190
OL,17,Fhomes in Ribchester in the Ribble
OL,18,FValley.
OL,20,FElectricity boss Paul Killilea said:
OL,21,F"The consistent high winds have
OL,22,Fhampered our repair times."
